#: app_ui/pages/settings.py:1193
msgid ""
"<b>Obsidian / Remotely Save:</b> point synchronization at the vault "
"directory above.<br>Exclude <code>.git/</code> client-side in Remotely "
"Save (Settings → Remotely Save → exclude list: <code>.git</code>) so the "
"server-side Git repo is not propagated to devices."
msgstr ""
"<b>Obsidian / Remotely Save:</b> Synchronisation auf das Vault-"
"Verzeichnis oben zeigen lassen.<br><code>.git/</code> in Remotely Save "
